{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2a937b35783ca8a9a8ae07f2b3a692a9d9b60e2fd712281de49cfc9bc8624f21", "ja": "（響主演の、PVの撮影が終わった。\n大きなリテイクもなく、いいものになったと思う！）", "zh": "（响主演的PV拍摄完毕了。\n过程中也没有大幅的重拍，应该有拍出好成果！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "2f4fca42045c7a3877bebe41133db2434d4bfa5ba66bdc92af0df3cbc93843af", "ja": "お疲れさま、{$P$}！\nえへへ、ずっと見ててくれて、ありがとねっ♪", "zh": "辛苦你了，{$P$}！\n嘿嘿，谢谢你一直看着本人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1002_p", "source_sha256": "56d54222ff27d970c74886fbdb345e4cfe58fae3e99f39ea47fb712f09f34ed4", "ja": "お疲れ様！　こっちこそ、ありがとうな。\nタイトなスケジュールに合わせてくれて。", "zh": "辛苦了！还让你配合这么紧凑的行程，\n我才要向你道谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "9b696e519bce48e0dab48f142e44d091403714aac57c12049a6eb9c19997b458", "ja": "桜が散る前に、撮影しなきゃいけなかったんでしょ？\nちゃんとわかってるから、気にしなくていいぞ！", "zh": "因为得在樱花谢掉之前拍摄对吧？\n本人都明白，你不用在意喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "2cc7dc53d72a1d9cef347e10889511eb02254c947a9d0b8e3f7979c5c52c667e", "ja": "それに、自分もこんなにキレイな桜の下で撮影できて、\nすっごく楽しかったし……♪", "zh": "更何况，能在这么美的樱花底下进行拍摄，\n本人也非常高兴……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "d09441540a27a3db2de9ad1eb30cd8b2e67026d122c15a0f142ead5a10eed781", "ja": "えへへっ、ステキな仕事をもらえてうれしいさ～。\nありがとねっ、{$P$}！", "zh": "嘿嘿，可以接到这么棒的工作真开心～\n谢啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d217bff8b377d6031c59a48e77d92640975aadc069d725f0f2bafa7d2bdeaa2b", "ja": "そう思ってくれたなら、俺もうれしいよ。\n……しかし、本当に綺麗だな。地元の穴場らしいけど。", "zh": "能让你这么觉得，我也很开心。\n……不过，真的好美。这里听说是当地不为人知的秘境。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "b51cb6242d6e75c8f6a21b1bb5ab56f7878bc7061f2c40fe8bab5e6f52d65456", "ja": "うん、自分もビックリしたぞっ！\nあ、でも沖縄の桜も、すっごくキレイだけどね！", "zh": "嗯，本人也很惊艳喔！\n啊，不过冲绳的樱花也非常美喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "e0cbdb802dfbad231be507b173f3afa966ac6a4de23a03884ae8f562809e0cf4", "ja": "こっちの桜とはちょっと違ってて、\n色が濃くて、うつむいて咲くんだ。だから……", "zh": "和这里的樱花不一样，\n颜色比较鲜艳，而且是垂着绽放。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "933d5e36cf0b6d3ab6f0705177117068dadc84cf0976a382ed65ff2ec90dcdd9", "ja": "木の下から見上げたら、花がみーんな、\nこっち向いてるみたいなんだぞ～。", "zh": "从树下往上看，\n花就像全～都面对着自己喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3d7409ab1b49930650acb408a7cd856a9a3fe3b8b299c1bf9d6b876d0a7dd513", "ja": "へえ、それは見ごたえがありそうだな。\n花に囲まれてる気分にもなりそうだし。", "zh": "哦，感觉很有看头呢。\n似乎能体验到被花朵环绕的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "bcec63f30e88b0b1e3c9264b48b0f978625f6388e09c794b5437a73c459ac396", "ja": "でしょでしょ？　えへへっ、\nいつか{$P$}にも見て欲しいさー。", "zh": "对吧对吧？\n嘿嘿，希望有朝一日能让{$P$}看到～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1e249d834dfe0622cdba22cb75e8141b0d826b0c0e496f3d1bd4b8fd7a471573", "ja": "そうだな、沖縄の桜か……。\nよし！", "zh": "我想想，冲绳的樱花啊……\n没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_1013", "source_sha256": "32a5dc8657af41b3c6fd7413408b5f9be280e57f8960e6064e5e5e837e750ee7", "ja": "一緒に行こう！", "zh": "一起去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2000_p", "source_sha256": "ac8a073d72b8d31ed38782ec18f9bdbcc3b6f7c1d7776841108b63511f370da5", "ja": "響、いつか一緒に、見に行こう！", "zh": "响，有朝一日我们一起去看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2001_013hib", "source_sha256": "e887e53dd5ed8a2a7e2731cff296982269114e645d8274c64411354c860f697b", "ja": "えっ……。\nええっ、ホントに！？", "zh": "咦……\n咦咦，真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2002_p", "source_sha256": "1dcd5617df0d2bbc980f732f63774db25a2f472b52d9faba597f4cb69bb5ce3a", "ja": "ああ、いつか響がトップアイドルになったら、\n全国ツアーを組んで、春の沖縄にも行くんだ。", "zh": "嗯，等哪天响成为顶尖偶像之后，\n我们就安排全国巡回演出，还要去春天的冲绳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2003_p", "source_sha256": "adc90ad7e27f8ef278a8ddcd42e2a46af75e971d39c13c150721b272bc8b911e", "ja": "つまり本州のファンも沖縄のファンも、みんなで一緒に\n行く、スーパーお花見ライブ！　……楽しそうだろ？", "zh": "也就是说，这将是跟本州和冲绳的粉丝一起\n共襄盛举的超级赏花演唱会！……感觉很好玩对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2004_013hib", "source_sha256": "9ffab83162bfe32a357ab1efca71887ba6cf5980df082e048f002e91784e4ee0", "ja": "みんなで……\nみんなで一緒に、島に……！", "zh": "跟大家……\n跟大家一起，去岛上……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2005_013hib", "source_sha256": "8dd402cca9935a1e94fd9224da9583c3cff11bfbc979bb8e6c5421c75863db88", "ja": "うぐ……うぎ……うぎぎぐぎ～～～～！\n{$P$}、卑怯だぞ～～～。", "zh": "呜咕……呜叽……呜叽叽咕叽～～～～！\n{$P$}，你太卑鄙了喔～～～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2006_p", "source_sha256": "701080793808fb61451087c50f3f69b713befd1456ce90d624a39cad19fd1743", "ja": "ええっ！？　ど、どうしてまた？", "zh": "咦咦！？你、你怎么这样说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2007_013hib", "source_sha256": "f6bb884d79c18a99624c1fa1b7bcbe4ca17b0d2d9f9cb2a2af780a70f1fbddfc", "ja": "急にそんなこと言われたら、自分、自分……\nうれしくなっちゃうでしょ～！　うぎぎぐぎ～～～！", "zh": "突然被你这么一说，本人、本人……\n当然会很开心啊～！呜叽叽咕叽～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2008_p", "source_sha256": "8f6ed361ef081b4a4da7be4e375d2d9594adec41df0cb83707ef450cc2656f99", "ja": "そ、そうか、うれし涙をこらえて……。\nごめんな、急にうれしがらせてしまって……。", "zh": "这、这样啊，你是在忍住开心的泪水……\n抱歉啊，突然惹你开心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2009_013hib", "source_sha256": "726b0af848914802444d218e8ee05683b6bb867b50ab7c6f389b5626428b49c3", "ja": "うう、わかればいいんだ……。ふう。\nよしっ！　自分、あらためて決心したぞ！", "zh": "呜呜，你知道错就好……呼……\n好！本人，再次下定决心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2010_013hib", "source_sha256": "6fbb6192bb5a9b661f3d904695ca6112af1ffe39e0bb20326ed94497e06cdf24", "ja": "自分はいつか絶対、トップアイドルになってみせる！\nだから……いつか絶対、実現しようねっ！", "zh": "本人有朝一日，绝对要成为顶尖偶像！\n所以……总有一天，一定要一起实现这个计划！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2011_013hib", "source_sha256": "6a3fedbf92bfbade1c56d755133cb9eb0491f096fb8c83951b74618c3fe7686f", "ja": "ファンのみんなと一緒に……ううん、劇場のみんなも、\nそれに、{$P$}も！", "zh": "和各位粉丝一起……不，也和剧场的伙伴，\n还有{$P$}一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0054_2012_013hib", "source_sha256": "584dd8dee6ffb68e9b9063145df19712529c17ddf2ddc1a7f09eaa469044bd02", "ja": "みんなで、み～んなで一緒に、島でお花見！\n約束だからね、{$P$}！", "zh": "大家，大～家一起，在岛上赏花！\n我们约好啰，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
